        ['Describe how to create a query that lists pupils in SHS 2 who scored 70 or more, sorted by score.', ['Add table', 'Fields', 'Class criteria', 'Score criteria', 'Sort and run'], 'Open Query Design and add the Pupils table. Add the fields Name, Class and Score. In the Class criteria type "SHS 2" and in the Score criteria type >=70. Set Sort to Descending for Score. Run the query.', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 3, 'theory', 5],
